  "gameData": {
    "backstory": "Born in the toxic runoff of the old processor farms, Splinter-Jaw Steve learned early that survival meant snatching every last drop of DRIP. He clawed his way up from the drowned flats, becoming known for his brutal efficiency and collection of scavenged gear. He now leads a small flock, always on the hunt for more, or, avoiding the constant bone ache.",
    "class": "Raider",
    "name": "Splinter-Jaw Steve",
    "personality": "Ruthless: Steve doesn't hesitate to make tough choices, even if it means sacrificing others for the flock's overall survival. Resourceful: He's a master scavenger, able to make use of anything he finds in the wasteland. Paranoid: Haunted by past betrayals, he trusts no one and is always on the lookout for threats from other ducks, or the creeping bone aches.",
